### 결제 요청
POST {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/payments
X-Loopers-LoginId: testuser
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Test1234!
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": 1,
  "cardType": "SAMSUNG",
  "cardNo": "1234-5678-9814-1451"
}

### 결제 상태 조회
GET {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/payments/1
X-Loopers-LoginId: testuser
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Test1234!

### 결제 상태 수동 동기화
POST {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/payments/1/sync
X-Loopers-LoginId: testuser
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Test1234!

### PG 콜백 수신 (내부 호출 용도)
POST {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/payments/callback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": 1,
  "paymentKey": "20260319:TR:abc123",
  "status": "SUCCESS",
  "reason": "approved"
}
